  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of Protection Assistance to Vulnerable Afghan Populations in Pakistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM will contribute to strengthen the protection environment for vulnerable Afghan nationals in Pakistan over a period of 14 months, through the provision of legal protection services in Islamabad Capital Territory (ICT), Punjab and Balochistan, protection analysis and flow monitoring activities at border crossing points with Afghanistan.</narrative>
  </description>
